<title>UK: BADMINTON-NEXT WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS AWARDED TO COPENHAGEN.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-NEXT WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS AWARDED TO COPENHAGEN.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The next world badminton championships and Sudirman Cup team event will be held in Copenhagen in May 1999.</p>
<p>The decision was announced by the president of the International Badminton Federation (IBF) Lu Shengrong after a meeting on Saturday of its council.</p>
<p>Denmark last hosted the world championships in 1991.</p>
